#
# ✒ Changelog:
#     - 1.1.0 (11/17/2026) [dendogg + Anthropic - Claude] — Ignore the
#       browser-test outputs (e2e-shots/, test-results/) and a locally built
#       toolman-site.zip; header brought up to the full standard.
#     - 1.0.0 (2026-07-22) [dendogg + Anthropic - Claude] — Initial ignore
#       patterns.
#
# ✒ Description:
#     Git ignore patterns for the toolMan ecosystem. The project is pure
#     static HTML/CSS/JS with no build step, so this mostly excludes OS and
#     editor litter, plus the ad hoc test tooling and its outputs.
#
# ✒ Key Features:
#     - Node tooling stays out of the repo: Playwright is installed ad hoc
#       for browser tests, and no package.json is ever committed
#     - Test outputs (screenshots, Playwright results) never get staged
#     - OS and editor litter from macOS, Windows, and JetBrains IDEs
#     - Keeps the shared .vscode/settings.json while ignoring personal
#       *.local.json overrides
#
# ✒ Other Important Information:
#     - Dependencies: git
#     - Compatible platforms: any git client
#     - The zero-install rule is deliberate: scripts/check.mjs needs only
#       Node, and scripts/e2e.mjs explains how to add Playwright ad hoc
# ==============================================================================

# Node tooling (only ever used ad hoc for testing — never committed)
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json

# Test outputs
e2e-shots/
test-results/
toolman-site.zip

# OS litter
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editor litter
.vscode/*.local.json
.idea/

# Logs and temp
*.log
*.tmp
